# ===== 编译产物 / 依赖 (体积大, 不上传) =====
**/target/
**/node_modules/
*.exe
*.dll

# ===== 打包必需的第三方二进制 (例外: 必须进仓库, 否则无法编译) =====
# Tauri 打包时 tauri.windows.conf.json 的 bundle.resources 会强校验这些文件,
# 缺失会直接报 "resource path `xxx.exe` doesn't exist" 导致 cargo check 失败。
# 均为可再分发的开源组件, 许可与源码地址见 src-tauri/licenses/第三方开源声明.txt
!client/privdesk-app/src-tauri/frpc.exe
!client/privdesk-app/src-tauri/tvnviewer.exe
!client/privdesk-app/src-tauri/gost.exe
!client/privdesk-app/src-tauri/wireguard.exe
!client/privdesk-app/src-tauri/wg.exe

# ===== frp 二进制 (无后缀, 单独排除) =====
**/privdesk-server_amd64
**/privdesk-server_arm64
**/frpc
**/frps

# ===== 敏感信息 (不能上传!) =====
*.cer
*.pfx
*.key
**/connection-info.txt
**/profile.json

# ===== 打包产物 =====
*.tar.gz
**/bundle/

# ===== 版本归档(走 Gitee 发行版, 不进代码仓库) =====
/releases/

# ===== 图标生成的中间产物 =====
**/icons/design_*.png
**/icons/source.png

# ===== 系统/编辑器 =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/

# ===== Rust =====
Cargo.lock
